<title>USA: Gateway 2000 cuts price of Big Screen PC.</title>
<headline>Gateway 2000 cuts price of Big Screen PC.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH SIOUX CITY, S.D. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gateway 2000 Inc said Wednesday it cut the price and enhanced the features of its Destination Big Screen PC family of products.</p>
<p>The series starts at $2,999 and includes among other things enhanced graphics and remote access capabilities. Prices of the Big Screen PC products, which are personal computers with a big-screen television monitors, previously ranged from $3,600 to $5,000, Gateway said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
